You don't say anything about your OS, version of R, sessionInfo(), 
amount of RAM, etc, etc, so really there is very little anybody can say 
for sure (this is like calling a mechanic on the phone and saying 'My 
car won't run. Can you help me?').

Some general prescriptives:

1.) Get more RAM. It's cheap these days.
2.) Use justRMA() or justGCRMA().
3.) Use a 64-bit OS with lots of RAM.
4.) If on windows or linux, you can use RMAexpress (google to find).

HTH,

