Index 5/10 are the two edges you set labels on.  For me, they are "Label
1" and "Label 2" as you set.  I would double check on Mac to see if they
are
like that.

If you do see these label texts, then the problem has more to do with
rendering.  Various things could go wrong: (just my speculation) a wrong
color could make text invisible, function "lines" could have trouble
dealing with labels, function "plot" might have problem on Mac, etc.

If you don't see these label texts, we need to look further into how these
labels are handled in Rgraphviz/graphviz on Mac.

